      <div class=3D"preformattedContent panelContent">
       <pre>@Pierre, Joseph-Pascal 02-14 10:19 a.m.
[...] is SOMA treated as resources/features, and the associated scopes are =
the actual roles?
p.s. although no direct relationship exists between role AND package templa=
te details tables, therefore how could we know which role is for which reso=
urce/feature

@Razmakhnine, Alexandre 02-14 11:27 a.m.
I am sure it is based on resource/features or saved into helm values, but I=
 need to validate it... do not remember</pre>
